WEBVTT

00:04.546 --> 00:05.671
Um...

00:05.672 --> 00:06.797
Shizuka.

00:06.798 --> 00:09.133
That's all for today's strategy meeting.

00:09.134 --> 00:11.427
- It's almost summer break.
- Um...

00:11.428 --> 00:14.014
We have to get ready, okay?

00:15.932 --> 00:18.350
I have something to say-pi.

00:18.351 --> 00:20.145
Undo the transformation now!

00:25.692 --> 00:26.859
4TH-GRADE GIRL FOUND DEAD IN HOKKAIDO
HOMICIDE IS NOT RULED OUT

00:26.860 --> 00:28.110
<i>According to the police,</i>

00:28.111 --> 00:30.362
<i>the victim was a fourth-grade girl,</i>

00:30.363 --> 00:31.864
<i>Marina Kirarazaka.</i>

00:31.865 --> 00:35.367
<i>There were signs of a blow to the head,</i>

00:35.368 --> 00:38.913
<i>so the police are investigating it
as a homicide.</i>

00:51.634 --> 00:53.762
Welcome home.

00:54.512 --> 00:55.555
Junya...

00:56.306 --> 00:57.931
I have to work again today.

00:57.932 --> 00:58.932
Please help me calm Mom down again.

00:58.933 --> 01:00.351
I'll do my best.

01:21.748 --> 01:25.126
TAKOPI'S ORIGINAL SIN

02:18.138 --> 02:19.179
EPISODE 4: AZUMA'S SALVATION

02:19.180 --> 02:20.890
Well then,

02:21.724 --> 02:24.394
just as your teacher said,

02:25.061 --> 02:26.896
yesterday, your friend,

02:27.480 --> 02:30.650
- Marina Kirarazaka, passed away.
- Marina...

02:31.943 --> 02:34.194
It must have been hard for all of you.

02:34.195 --> 02:35.655
Just within your ability is fine.

02:36.406 --> 02:40.785
Is it okay if you talk to us for a bit?

02:43.204 --> 02:44.663
It'll be okay.

02:44.664 --> 02:47.917
She was in the Memory Box, so
her actual time of death wasn't revealed.

02:48.626 --> 02:51.504
All the fingerprints were wiped too.
It'll be okay.

02:52.255 --> 02:54.841
The geological survey was unexpected,

02:55.425 --> 02:56.259
but it's all good.

02:56.843 --> 02:59.554
If we keep quiet like this,
they won't find out.

03:00.346 --> 03:01.972
- It'll be okay.
- Excuse me.

03:01.973 --> 03:02.973
It'll be okay.

03:02.974 --> 03:04.184
But...

03:04.767 --> 03:07.395
is it really okay to keep quiet-pi?

03:09.939 --> 03:10.857
What?

03:11.649 --> 03:13.817
I've been thinking a lot-pi.

03:13.818 --> 03:16.945
I want to talk to everyone about Marina

03:16.946 --> 03:19.032
and what to do from now on.

03:19.782 --> 03:21.367
We've been found out.

03:22.160 --> 03:23.870
They found her.

03:24.537 --> 03:27.206
What's the point
of talking about this now?

03:27.207 --> 03:29.292
- You octopus!
- But...

03:31.336 --> 03:35.840
I'm sure Marina's mama
and papa are devastated too.

03:36.549 --> 03:40.678
<i>I feel like I have to do something-pi.</i>

03:41.763 --> 03:45.599
For Marina and her family,

03:45.600 --> 03:49.938
we should tell the truth
instead of hiding it.

03:50.563 --> 03:52.189
<i>That's right.</i>

03:52.190 --> 03:55.109
<i>As long as I tell the truth now...</i>

03:56.110 --> 03:59.239
Hey, aren't you going
to have a strategy meeting?

04:00.240 --> 04:03.993
Summer break is coming up.
We can't slack off.

04:06.412 --> 04:10.332
No. If we leave the city
at a time like this...

04:10.333 --> 04:14.379
Azuma, I can go to Tokyo, right?

04:15.046 --> 04:19.634
You said it, right?
We can go during summer break.

04:24.555 --> 04:27.391
So, about...

04:27.392 --> 04:30.561
- <i>That's right. I have to do it properly.</i>
- the bullet train schedule...

04:32.146 --> 04:34.899
<i>Because I said I could do it.</i>

04:35.900 --> 04:39.529
<i>And I was the one
who wanted to hide the body.</i>

04:40.113 --> 04:41.697
<i>But they found her.</i>

04:41.698 --> 04:43.782
<i>I could have done better.</i>

04:43.783 --> 04:45.367
<i>No, it's okay.</i>

04:45.368 --> 04:47.160
<i>I'll do better next time.</i>

04:47.161 --> 04:50.080
<i>I have to deceive everyone
and go to Tokyo.</i>

04:50.081 --> 04:51.999
<i>Then Kuze will continue to--</i>

04:52.000 --> 04:53.334
Hello?

04:56.170 --> 04:58.256
It's late, are you still studying?

05:03.678 --> 05:04.594
Junya.

05:04.595 --> 05:07.557
Sorry, I knocked.

05:08.099 --> 05:09.434
No, it's okay.

05:10.435 --> 05:13.813
By the way, how's that case going?

05:20.278 --> 05:22.196
That girl was in your class, right?

05:22.864 --> 05:24.657
I wonder if her friends are feeling lost.

05:25.783 --> 05:27.535
How's the atmosphere in class?

05:28.453 --> 05:30.204
You have to be careful too.

05:30.830 --> 05:33.041
If there's anything, you can talk to me.

05:33.541 --> 05:35.917
Are the police scary?

05:35.918 --> 05:36.919
By the way, was that girl

05:38.004 --> 05:39.463
the one you always hung out with...

05:39.464 --> 05:40.798
Sorry.

05:41.883 --> 05:43.675
I'm going to the bathroom.

05:43.676 --> 05:45.636
Go ahead.

05:50.725 --> 05:51.893
<i>Come to think of it,</i>

05:52.477 --> 05:54.854
Marina had been acting strange lately.

05:56.606 --> 05:58.023
Strange?

05:58.024 --> 05:59.400
In what way?

06:01.069 --> 06:03.195
<i>She suddenly started acting
so subservient to her.</i>

06:03.196 --> 06:04.112
<i>That's right.</i>

06:04.113 --> 06:06.531
<i>Did she figure out her weakness?</i>

06:06.532 --> 06:07.866
<i>Poor thing.</i>

06:07.867 --> 06:09.117
<i>Who?</i>

06:09.118 --> 06:10.869
<i>It's her.</i>

06:10.870 --> 06:12.622
<i>Kuze.</i>

06:14.624 --> 06:16.375
<i>I did as you said, Azuma.</i>

06:16.376 --> 06:18.628
<i>I didn't answer what I didn't understand.</i>

06:19.921 --> 06:20.962
That's good.

06:20.963 --> 06:23.715
Everyone must think
the murderer is an adult.

06:23.716 --> 06:25.300
- So--
- But they said they would come

06:25.301 --> 06:26.803
and question me again.

06:27.470 --> 06:29.847
Summer break should be fine, right?

06:32.016 --> 06:33.725
We can go, right?

06:33.726 --> 06:34.769
Of course.

06:35.478 --> 06:36.645
MATH - AREA

06:36.646 --> 06:39.857
<i>It'll be okay. We can definitely go.</i>

06:40.650 --> 06:42.442
<i>Let's work on your alibi.</i>

06:42.443 --> 06:43.611
NAME: NAOKI AZUMA

06:44.195 --> 06:45.153
<i>Think about it.</i>

06:45.154 --> 06:47.490
<i>If you don't say anything,
they'll suspect you.</i>

06:48.449 --> 06:51.701
<i>Sorry, I was the one
who told you not to answer.</i>

06:51.702 --> 06:52.745
<i>I'm sorry.</i>

06:56.165 --> 06:57.582
<i>It's okay.</i>

06:57.583 --> 07:00.420
<i>They definitely won't suspect you.</i>

07:01.045 --> 07:02.379
<i>I'll do a good job.</i>

07:02.380 --> 07:03.840
Azuma.

07:05.216 --> 07:06.634
The test is over.

07:10.012 --> 07:13.808
54

07:52.013 --> 07:53.389
You can eat it.

07:55.641 --> 07:59.144
It must be tough for you too.

07:59.145 --> 08:01.939
You've been working hard
late into the night lately.

08:03.983 --> 08:09.071
<i>Does Mom know everything
I've been through?</i>

08:09.906 --> 08:12.866
Mom, listen to me.

08:12.867 --> 08:14.076
I have something to tell you.

08:14.911 --> 08:16.954
You don't have to work hard anymore.

08:18.998 --> 08:21.541
No matter how bad you are at it,

08:21.542 --> 08:24.544
you can't just skip studying every day

08:24.545 --> 08:27.923
and purposely get bad grades
just to get attention.

08:27.924 --> 08:31.427
I think that's really childish.

08:32.553 --> 08:34.138
So you don't have to try so hard.

08:34.680 --> 08:37.016
I've decided not
to put in any more effort.

08:37.517 --> 08:39.851
You can have snacks every day

08:39.852 --> 08:41.895
and get whatever grade you want.

08:41.896 --> 08:43.731
Do whatever you like.

08:45.316 --> 08:46.192
Wait.

08:47.610 --> 08:49.028
Mom.

08:50.029 --> 08:51.239
I...

08:52.615 --> 08:54.408
Go ahead, eat.

09:26.023 --> 09:26.983
Hey.

09:27.900 --> 09:29.193
Are you okay?

09:40.371 --> 09:43.707
I got another call
from the police just now.

09:43.708 --> 09:48.379
I have to go to the station again
this summer break.

09:52.758 --> 09:56.803
But I have to visit Chappy
during summer break.

09:56.804 --> 09:58.055
So I can't go.

09:58.848 --> 10:01.017
It'll be a problem if I get caught.

10:02.184 --> 10:03.101
So I have to find a replacement.

10:03.102 --> 10:06.479
No problem. Just tell me.

10:06.480 --> 10:08.816
I'll solve everything for you.

10:09.442 --> 10:12.987
I'll help you no matter what.

10:16.824 --> 10:18.242
Thank you,

10:19.619 --> 10:20.995
Azuma.

10:22.288 --> 10:23.331
Well then,

10:24.624 --> 10:26.709
can you take this and turn yourself in?

10:35.509 --> 10:38.179
- You're playing games again!
- Huh?

10:39.055 --> 10:40.680
You have a test tomorrow.

10:40.681 --> 10:43.308
You won't get a perfect score like this.

10:43.309 --> 10:45.436
You sound just like Mom.

10:46.187 --> 10:48.230
Don't worry. I'll be fine.

10:51.817 --> 10:53.526
AWARD CERTIFICATE

10:53.527 --> 10:56.697
<i>That's right. It was exactly like he said.</i>

10:57.281 --> 10:59.491
You're so studious. I'm impressed.

10:59.492 --> 11:00.409
Mom.

11:01.243 --> 11:05.456
When you go to elementary school,
you might surpass your brother in no time.

11:08.250 --> 11:11.211
<i>That never happened. Not even once.</i>

11:11.212 --> 11:12.170
NAOKI AZUMA - 95

11:12.171 --> 11:14.340
<i>Junya was a genius.</i>

11:14.840 --> 11:15.925
Azuma.

11:17.051 --> 11:18.510
You scored over 90.

11:18.511 --> 11:20.887
Your mom is a doctor, right?

11:20.888 --> 11:21.931
That's amazing.

11:23.099 --> 11:25.475
<i>My big brother always got 100.</i>

11:25.476 --> 11:27.894
<i>Why can't you do that?</i>

11:27.895 --> 11:29.438
<i>I raised you the same way.</i>

11:30.147 --> 11:33.066
Azuma is at the top of the grade
in the academic assessment?

11:33.067 --> 11:36.195
And second in the whole town.
That's amazing!

11:37.113 --> 11:39.864
<i>My big brother ranked first
in the whole prefecture.</i>

11:39.865 --> 11:41.783
<i>I made both of you wear the same clothes</i>

11:41.784 --> 11:44.036
<i>and eat the same food.</i>

11:45.913 --> 11:47.832
<i>But there was a silver lining.</i>

11:48.416 --> 11:50.250
Is this mine?

11:50.251 --> 11:52.920
Didn't you say your eyesight got worse?

11:54.046 --> 11:56.507
After all, your brother
has never used one before.

11:57.633 --> 11:59.593
Thank you, Mom.

12:00.177 --> 12:01.261
<i>Well then, do well on the next test.</i>

12:01.262 --> 12:04.265
NAOKI AZUMA - 93

12:12.606 --> 12:15.651
<i>Then came a turning point.</i>

12:16.277 --> 12:17.695
<i>Junya had gone bad.</i>

12:18.320 --> 12:20.321
Is it true that you're working part-time?

12:20.322 --> 12:22.031
Don't worry about it.

12:22.032 --> 12:23.491
That's not good.

12:23.492 --> 12:25.536
- What if your grades drop?
- <i>This is my chance!</i>

12:26.787 --> 12:30.540
<i>I'm sure my big brother will get involved
with gangsters from now on.</i>

12:30.541 --> 12:33.001
<i>Mom will place her hopes</i>

12:33.002 --> 12:36.254
<i>on her steady and reliable second son
as the successor to Azuma Clinic.</i>

12:36.255 --> 12:37.464
JUNYA!

12:37.465 --> 12:39.508
SCHOOL FESTIVAL 2-1,
IT'S GREAT MEETING YOU!

12:43.637 --> 12:46.807
<i>No, that was his strength.</i>

12:48.476 --> 12:53.189
<i>Besides, his grades wouldn't have
dropped because of that.</i>

12:53.731 --> 12:57.484
<i>It only made Mom constantly
worry about him and admire him.</i>

12:57.485 --> 13:01.113
<i>All I have is my dedication.</i>

13:02.823 --> 13:04.407
<i>Dedicated but stupid.</i>

13:04.408 --> 13:06.451
<i>I already know it.</i>

13:06.452 --> 13:08.453
<i>Junya is the only one who inherited</i>

13:08.454 --> 13:10.664
<i>that sharp mind and quick thinking,</i>

13:11.332 --> 13:15.211
<i>and that silky black hair,
which he ruined by dying it.</i>

13:16.086 --> 13:17.879
<i>And also Mom's</i>

13:17.880 --> 13:20.257
<i>beautifully defined,
as if they're drawn on,</i>

13:21.801 --> 13:22.927
<i>double eyelids.</i>

13:23.969 --> 13:25.095
What?

13:26.347 --> 13:27.890
Nothing.

13:32.186 --> 13:34.021
<i>I remember she's...</i>

13:35.147 --> 13:37.690
Azuma, are those glasses branded too?

13:37.691 --> 13:40.360
- No, at the optician's...
- You piece of human scum!

13:40.361 --> 13:42.987
How dare you waltz into school
so shamelessly?

13:42.988 --> 13:44.113
Die!

13:44.114 --> 13:47.827
<i>Hey, there's bullying
in the class where I'm the class rep?</i>

13:49.453 --> 13:53.040
<i>I have to do something
to protect the clinic's reputation.</i>

13:54.333 --> 13:56.084
Kuze, are you okay?

13:56.085 --> 13:57.794
I'm the class rep.

13:57.795 --> 13:59.588
If there's anything I can do to help...

14:02.132 --> 14:03.551
It's fine.

14:07.888 --> 14:09.932
<i>That's impossible!</i>

14:11.308 --> 14:12.559
<i>But...</i>

14:12.560 --> 14:14.477
This is a job where lives are on the line.

14:14.478 --> 14:16.437
Failure is not an option.

14:16.438 --> 14:19.066
- If you can't do everything perfectly...
- <i>That's right.</i>

14:19.733 --> 14:21.527
<i>I have to be perfect.</i>

14:22.069 --> 14:24.864
<i>If it were Junya,
I'm sure at a time like this...</i>

15:07.615 --> 15:11.201
It won't change anything.

15:11.785 --> 15:12.703
See you.

15:14.163 --> 15:18.666
<i>Even a girl who looks just like Mom</i>

15:18.667 --> 15:20.502
<i>doesn't expect anything from me.</i>

15:22.004 --> 15:23.380
<i>I don't like that.</i>

15:27.009 --> 15:28.969
You're all I have.

15:30.095 --> 15:31.221
Help me.

15:36.810 --> 15:39.146
<i>This time, I have to do it perfectly.</i>

15:39.688 --> 15:43.066
<i>Because so much is expected of me.</i>

15:43.067 --> 15:45.193
<i>I'm the only one Kuze has.</i>

15:45.194 --> 15:46.111
<i>Just me.</i>

15:46.779 --> 15:47.737
Um...

15:47.738 --> 15:49.740
- Are you really okay with this-pi?
- <i>Only me...</i>

15:50.449 --> 15:51.992
<i>Only me...</i>

15:52.993 --> 15:55.662
<i>This is okay, right, Mom?</i>

15:55.663 --> 15:59.624
<i>This way, I'll definitely be like you,</i>

15:59.625 --> 16:01.585
<i>working to help people.</i>

16:02.378 --> 16:04.338
<i>I'll save many lives.</i>

16:05.297 --> 16:06.674
<i>I'll become a doctor.</i>

16:08.133 --> 16:09.218
<i>Azuma.</i>

16:13.389 --> 16:14.473
<i>Azuma.</i>

16:22.940 --> 16:24.858
Azuma, I...

16:27.444 --> 16:30.531
You're the only one I can count on now.

16:31.657 --> 16:33.867
So I'll keep waiting for you.

16:34.451 --> 16:37.538
Even if you turn yourself in
and go to juvenile detention,

16:38.122 --> 16:40.289
I'll always wait for you.

16:40.290 --> 16:42.835
In the meantime, I'll look for Chappy.

16:43.502 --> 16:45.004
- So...
- Really?

16:47.506 --> 16:52.219
You really won't give up on me?

16:59.059 --> 17:00.436
It'll be okay.

17:01.270 --> 17:02.980
It'll be okay...

17:04.148 --> 17:05.774
It'll be okay.

17:09.069 --> 17:10.320
<i>Oh, right.</i>

17:11.822 --> 17:18.328
<i>I remember now, that day
was the last time Mom hugged me.</i>

17:28.672 --> 17:29.673
Hey.

17:30.382 --> 17:31.842
Where are you going so early?

17:37.473 --> 17:38.515
<i>Junya.</i>

17:49.318 --> 17:50.986
You killed her, didn't you?

17:51.612 --> 17:53.697
You're a disgrace to our family.

17:54.364 --> 17:56.825
Everything is ruined because of you.

17:57.493 --> 17:59.828
Mom's clinic and my future.

18:00.579 --> 18:03.540
Not only are you incompetent,
but you're dragging us down too?

18:04.124 --> 18:06.376
How are you going to take responsibility?

18:08.670 --> 18:09.505
Hey.

18:11.215 --> 18:12.674
Are you okay?

18:13.759 --> 18:16.177
You're stressing over something,
aren't you?

18:16.178 --> 18:18.847
That's why I told you to talk to me.

18:20.224 --> 18:21.683
I'll listen, no matter what it is.

18:26.146 --> 18:28.023
You wouldn't understand.

18:28.524 --> 18:32.693
You're capable and have good character.
You can do anything.

18:32.694 --> 18:35.614
Everyone only cares about you.

18:36.323 --> 18:39.159
But I have no one.

18:40.035 --> 18:42.538
I haven't made any friends.
I've just been working hard.

18:43.288 --> 18:44.790
But I can't do anything.

18:45.457 --> 18:49.128
I can't do a single thing
people ask of me.

18:50.045 --> 18:54.758
Even Mom's disappointed in me
and has given up.

18:56.051 --> 18:59.971
No one's interested in me
or expects anything from me.

18:59.972 --> 19:01.723
All I have left is...

19:03.392 --> 19:04.893
Kuze.

19:11.108 --> 19:12.276
No!

19:13.694 --> 19:15.154
You have me, right?

19:15.779 --> 19:18.197
I've been saying this for a while.

19:18.198 --> 19:20.325
I'll listen to anything you say.

19:20.951 --> 19:23.661
Test scores aren't important at all.

19:23.662 --> 19:25.997
They don't matter!

19:25.998 --> 19:29.000
If something bothers you
or you can't figure it out,

19:29.001 --> 19:30.418
you can tell me.

19:30.419 --> 19:32.087
I want to hear it.

19:33.005 --> 19:33.964
<i>Because you're...</i>

19:35.424 --> 19:37.217
<i>my little brother!</i>

19:39.011 --> 19:40.429
If you can't do it,

19:41.138 --> 19:43.265
just say that you can't.

19:46.894 --> 19:48.478
Naoki!

19:52.357 --> 19:53.983
AZUMA CLINIC

19:53.984 --> 19:55.110
Besides,

19:56.153 --> 19:58.697
no one in this world can do everything.

19:59.740 --> 20:02.409
I'm terrible at Monster Hunter.

20:03.118 --> 20:03.951
Just between you and me,

20:03.952 --> 20:07.580
I always ask my girlfriend to help me.

20:07.581 --> 20:10.583
And the pancakes Mom used to make

20:10.584 --> 20:12.919
were really bad.

20:12.920 --> 20:13.836
You're lying.

20:13.837 --> 20:15.380
It's true.

20:15.964 --> 20:17.423
<i>They were undercooked.</i>

20:17.424 --> 20:19.425
<i>But she made them before her night shift,</i>

20:19.426 --> 20:21.637
<i>and they hardened
after being in the fridge.</i>

20:22.971 --> 20:25.182
<i>So I think she's someone
who works really hard,</i>

20:26.516 --> 20:29.436
a lot like you.

20:33.982 --> 20:35.192
Junya...

20:37.653 --> 20:38.946
These glasses.

20:40.530 --> 20:42.366
Mom bought them for me.

20:43.075 --> 20:45.159
The prescription doesn't match anymore.

20:45.160 --> 20:46.662
But I couldn't tell her.

20:49.331 --> 20:52.042
And... And I...

20:57.756 --> 21:00.133
have something to tell you.

21:01.134 --> 21:03.512
I must get it off my chest.

21:24.074 --> 21:25.116
<i>Did you hear?</i>

21:25.117 --> 21:26.701
<i>The son of that clinic</i>

21:26.702 --> 21:29.120
<i>is involved in that case.</i>

21:29.121 --> 21:30.580
<i>Really?</i>

21:31.164 --> 21:32.540
<i>That well-behaved child?</i>

21:32.541 --> 21:34.834
<i>He must have been forced by someone.</i>

21:34.835 --> 21:37.086
<i>The police seem to think so too.</i>

21:37.087 --> 21:38.587
<i>That's horrible.</i>

21:38.588 --> 21:39.672
<i>Yes.</i>

21:39.673 --> 21:43.050
<i>I heard that it was his classmate.</i>

21:43.051 --> 21:44.428
Shizuka.

21:46.722 --> 21:49.766
Azuma won't help me anymore.

21:53.729 --> 21:54.980
Shizuka.

21:56.231 --> 21:58.317
What should we do now-pi?

21:59.735 --> 22:02.863
We should tell the truth too...

22:03.989 --> 22:05.449
What are you talking about?

22:08.035 --> 22:09.077
Pi?

22:10.287 --> 22:12.247
Summer break starts today.

22:14.499 --> 22:15.876
Is that so-pi?

22:19.880 --> 22:20.756
So let's go!

22:22.049 --> 22:23.175
To Tokyo!
